# Rowan, Scion of War: the amount of life lost is worked out as the ability resolves (CR 608.2h) and does not grow with later
# losses, and the ability is a sorcery (CR 602.5d). On turn three Bot1 has lost no life: it is refused the activation in the
# combat phase (`!` at the declaration of attackers), activates Rowan in its second main phase (X is 0), then Lightning Bolts
# itself for 3. The black Scathe Zombies ({2}{B}) is still {2}{B}: with a Jet and a Sapphire's two mana it is refused.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Rowan, Scion of War
Lightning Bolt
Scathe Zombies
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

